      "created_at": "2026-10-09T14:15:36Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-10-09T14:15:36Z",
      "body": "Superseded by the light archive PR, which keeps main to an index and moves the 115 MB bundle to iCloud (icloud:UOR-R4/results/deepseek/ds-bundle-icloud.tar, tar md5 3d6233391fa48623e18589e2778d326a, bundle md5 14d17ccd22f1ee196e1479866823be4f). Reasons: GitHub rejects files above 100 MB, two-part storage invites reassembly mistakes, and the project's own storage decision puts bulk material in iCloud with main holding the index. The new PR is 428 KB and carries the same patches plus a fuller index including the failed restoration approaches. References #820",
